OL,3,GNEWSACompany fined #300k after worker
OL,4,Ahit by tonne of metal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man says his wife has been left with
OL,7,F"constant worry" after he suffered
OL,8,F"life-changing" injuries when he was
OL,9,Fstruck by a one-tonne metal hopper when
OL,10,Fit fell off a forklift truck.
OL,12,FGary Taylor, who was 63 at the time,
OL,13,Fsuffered fractures to his skull, neck
OL,14,Fand spine, as well as two broken ribs
OL,15,Fand a severe cuts to his forehead when
OL,16,Fhe was hit by the insecure load.
OL,18,FManufacturing company E H Hassell &
OL,19,FSons Limited on Newstead Industrial
OL,20,FEstate in Trentham, Stoke-on-Trent, has
OL,21,Fbeen fined #300,000 over the incident.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
